{
 "_report": "Thalassa, rebuilt on the V3 world kit (Map Logic Pack). Arrival stays the Port Saltreach Docks (052: harbor boat from Dustara, Ghost Ship Hold + Helix Freighter warps, M07/M17b/S40 spots); the kit Spaceport sits west of the docks as an extra section with its own ship home. Saltreach town = the docks + Saltreach Market (053, Recovery Bay/shop doors and the Smuggler's Freighter, all kept) + Saltreach Lane Homes (Harbormaster's Office, Fish Market Stall) east of the market. Boardwalk Crossing is the hub: north to the Saltreach Quiet Court (Captain's Cabin) with the Secret Grove (hidden reward) behind it; south to Shell Flats (S41 beach kid) -> Coral Cove (sea arch, S42 Anchorath) -> Open Water shore (water-edge dead end, chest); east to Lagoon Fork. Lagoon Fork: north up the Dune Stairway to the Sea Cave (entrance + 3 floors, chest in the Deep Chamber); south to the Saltreach Farmstead, which loops back west to Shell Flats; east to Dune Junction. Dune Junction: north up Lighthouse Bluff to the Tidewater Arena (battle arena) and the Harbor Relay Tower (Trial Floor 060 -> Keeper Room 061); east to the Helix hideout (disguised boathouse -> secret lab); south to Tidal Inlet -> Driftwood Hollows (dead end, chest).",
